OL,3,CArmed police officers to be deployed
OL,4,Cfor UK's biggest Pride festival
OL,6,FArmed police officers will be deployed
OL,7,Ffor the UK's largest Pride festival in
OL,8,FBrighton following the attack on
OL,9,FBerlin's Pride event.
OL,11,FDefence Secretary Wes Streeting
OL,12,Fcondemned the "absolutely horrific"
OL,13,Fvan and stabbing attack in the German
OL,14,Fcapital that left one person dead and
OL,15,Finjured at least 29 others.
OL,17,FThe suspect ` named as Abdul Ballout
OL,18,Fand said to have links to the so-
OL,19,Fcalled Islamic State group ` was shot
OL,20,Fdead by police on Sunday after being
OL,21,Fon the run for nearly 24 hours.
OL,26,@tD@OOUtD@cO]
