OL,3,CArmed police officers to be deployed
OL,4,Cfor UK's biggest Pride festival
OL,6,FHe was suspected of slamming a van
OL,7,Finto people gathered for the festival
OL,8,Fin the German capital, killing one
OL,9,Fperson, before stabbing others with a
OL,10,Fmachete.
OL,12,FThe attack came a week before the UK's
OL,13,Fbiggest Pride festival is due to take
OL,14,Fplace in Brighton and Hove ` which
OL,15,Fattracts an estimated 500,000 people
OL,16,Fto the city.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G2/6
