OL,3,CArmed police officers to be deployed
OL,4,Cfor UK's biggest Pride festival
OL,6,FA spokesperson for Sussex Police said:
OL,7,F"As we look ahead to Brighton and Hove
OL,8,FPride, I want to reassure those
OL,9,Fattending, as well as residents,
OL,10,Fbusinesses and visitors across the
OL,11,Fcity, that their safety remains our
OL,12,Ftop priority.
OL,26,@oD@AOU
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G3/6
