PN,38404
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F384A1785253711
OL,3,CArmed police officers to be deployed
OL,4,Cfor UK's biggest Pride festival
OL,6,F"We will be working tirelessly this
OL,7,Fweek and throughout the weekend,
OL,8,Fbuilding on the extensive planning
OL,9,Fthat has taken place over many months
OL,10,Fwith event organisers, Brighton and
OL,11,FHove City Council and other partners,
OL,12,Fto keep everyone safe and ensure an
OL,13,Feffective policing operation is in
OL,14,Fplace.
OL,16,F"Uniformed policing, plain-clothed
OL,17,Fofficers and specialist teams
OL,18,Fincluding armed officers will be
OL,19,Fdeployed across the city, which all
OL,20,Fform part of our comprehensive plans
OL,21,Ffor policing this event.
OL,26,@nD@AOUxD@AOU
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G4/6
