PN,38405
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F384A1785253711
OL,3,CArmed police officers to be deployed
OL,4,Cfor UK's biggest Pride festival
OL,6,F"We encourage everyone attending Pride
OL,7,Fto enjoy the celebrations, look out
OL,8,Ffor one another, and report any
OL,9,Fconcerns.
OL,11,F"If something doesn't feel right,
OL,12,Fspeak to one of our officers or a
OL,13,Fmember of security. In an emergency,
OL,14,Falways dial 999."
OL,16,FThe leader of Brighton & Hove City
OL,17,FCouncil, Bella Sankey, said in a post
OL,18,Fon the council's Facebook page: "We
OL,19,Fare deeply saddened by the attacks at
OL,20,FBerlin Pride and our thoughts with all
OL,21,Fthose affected.
OL,26,@nD@AOUsD@AOUvD@QO]zD@aOU
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G5/6
