OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,385,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38406
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F384A1785253711
OL,3,CArmed police officers to be deployed
OL,4,Cfor UK's biggest Pride festival
OL,6,F"We stand in solidarity with the
OL,7,FLGBTQI+ community and, as we look
OL,8,Fforward to Brighton & Hove Pride this
OL,9,Fweekend, we want to reassure all those
OL,10,Fattending that we are working closely
OL,11,Fwith Brighton & Hove Pride, Sussex
OL,12,FPolice and our other partners to keep
OL,13,Feveryone safe.
OL,15,F"We look forward to Pride being a
OL,16,Fcelebration of the diversity, joy and,
OL,17,Fabove all, the unity of our community."
OL,26,@nD@AOUwD@AOUyD@gO]
